      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Valkyrie\r\u0022We have been watching you... Wotan himself sends us - He is grateful, he awaits the day the Clans recover his gifts. One more rune can be found East of this place, past the Empire cities Fronde and Fichdaer.\u0022",
