    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S116SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S116EV0021",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "win scenario",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S116SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S116EV0021",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Morok\r\u0022Springfrost, Cragwell and Skymine, found at last... And the Runes that they had guarded are safe once more! I will hand the runes over to the Loremasters for safekeeping, they will be able to define their use.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S116SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S116EV0022",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Day 35",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S116SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S116EV0022",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Engineer\r\u0022King Morok! We have news! We searched the countryside for those who witnessed the slaying of your Gymner... It is most strange!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S116SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S116EV0022",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Morok \r\u0022What! What did you discover? We know that Gymner did not seal the gate and Bethrezen is loosed upon the world once more...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S116SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S116EV0022",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Engineer\r\u0022Gymner did succeed in using the runes, and he did this despite the onslaught of not just Bethrezen\u0027s Legions, but also the Undead minions of Mortis herself!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S116SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S116EV0022",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Morok \r\u0022Mortis!!! Why does she fight us still! Was she not satisfied with slaying King Sturmir Ten years ago?!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 3
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S116SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S116EV0022",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Engineer\r\u0022The minions ignored our forces until the gate to Bethrezen\u0027s dungeon was opened. The Undead instead bent their efforts upon eradicating the Legions! It was merely a battle between these two evil factions...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 4
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S116SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S116EV0022",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Morok\r\u0022And my Poor Gymner, caught betwixt!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 5
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S116SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S116EV0022",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Loremaster\r\u0022But wait! If Gymner did succeed in performing the runic ceremony... why then did Bethrezen escape! I must ask the Loremasters if something is amiss...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 6
    },
    {
